window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Before tragedy left her crippled, Artemis \"Temi\" Sidaris was a world-class tennis player at the height of her career. The sport was her passion, her dream, and all she ever wanted to do. Fighting monsters...was not part of the plan. </p> <p>But when a pair of pointy-eared strangers offers to heal her injury if she's willing to wield a powerful sword to protect humanity...how can she resist? </p> <p><i>Destiny Unchosen</i> is a novella that takes place between <i>Torrent</i> and <i>Thorn Fall</i>. </p>"; 
